    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.8.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.8.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said to me, \"Take a large scroll and write on it with an ordinary pen: Maher-Shalal-Hash-Baz.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I called in Uriah the priest and Zechariah son of Jeberekiah as reliable witnesses for me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I made love to the prophetess, and she conceived and gave birth to a son. And the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.8.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.8.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said to me, \"Name him Maher-Shalal-Hash-Baz.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For before the boy knows how to say 'My father' or 'My mother,' the wealth of Damascus and the plunder of Samaria will be carried off by the king of Assyria.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.8.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.8.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "spoke to me again:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Because this people has rejected",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 8:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the gently flowing waters of Shiloah",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 8:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and rejoices over Rezin",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 8:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and the son of Remaliah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "therefore the Lord is about to bring against them",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 8:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the mighty floodwaters of the Euphrates—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 8:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the king of Assyria with all his pomp.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 8:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "It will overflow all its channels,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 8:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "run over all its banks",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and sweep on into Judah, swirling over it,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 8:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "passing through it and reaching up to the neck.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 8:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Its outspread wings will cover the breadth of your land,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 8:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Immanuel",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Raise the war cry,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "you nations, and be shattered!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 8:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Listen, all you distant lands.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 8:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Prepare for battle, and be shattered!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 8:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Prepare for battle, and be shattered!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Devise your strategy, but it will be thwarted;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 8:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "propose your plan, but it will not stand,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 8:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "for God is with us.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.8.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.8.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "says to me with his strong hand upon me, warning me not to follow the way of this people:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Do not call conspiracy",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 8:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "everything this people calls a conspiracy;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 8:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "do not fear what they fear,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 8:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and do not dread it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.8.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.8.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty is the one you are to regard as holy,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 8:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "he is the one you are to fear,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 8:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "he is the one you are to dread.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He will be a holy place;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 8:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "for both Israel and Judah he will be",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 8:14"
      },
